@s(3)I shall personally take part
in this battle. Send the troops
when you're prepared.

@M(1)They are attacking our
headquarters with all
their soldiers!

@M(1)The Paladins fight valiantly,
but 'tis only a matter of
time till they are overrun!

Use everything we have.@w(6)
@M(1)Attack from both sides
and annihilate them!

I will not allow the
Crystallization Cauldron@w(6)
@M(1)to be used any further.

@M(1)May I ask that the king
retract the marriage he
arranged for me?

@M(1)If it all was for some
hunk of scrap iron, it is a
disgrace to the dead.

@M(1)I'll catch that witch and
make her spill her guts
about that Cauldron.

@M(3)Heed my words.
Do not cause undue harm
to the witch. @w(12)She's—

@s(3)Ah, Sire. I hear your
command. The witch
shall be sacrificed.

@s(3)I'll tear off those wings of
yours@w(6) and remove my shame
for having known you.

@M(1)Ragnanival suffered a
crushing defeat from the Vanir,
under their new queen.

@M(1)That can't be...!@w(12)
How is the king!?@w(6)
Is the king all right?

@M(1)King Odin has been
wounded by arcane bolts and
has returned to the castle.

@M(1)The enemy will surely
take this opportunity to
invade the castle.

@M(1)Your Highness, for now,
please return to the kingdom
and assist King Odin.

@s(3)@bwishes to make a deal
with her father—the king
of the nation!?

@M(3)Death will become more
horrifying and abominable
than ever before.

@M(3)When the world sees
its demise, remember the
fury you unleashed.

The only way to enter that
land now is to accept death;
there is no other way.

@s(3)The fires of Hel shall
obliterate you. Pray
while you still can.

@M(1)after the attack, my father
was the kingdom's savior
and was given the crown!

@s(3)@M(1)Our soldiers have been
pushed back, and some have
deserted from the front line.

@s(3)If it draws in all the
Phozons, our forest and
our people cannot live.

@s(3)You will need to revive the
country and get the Cauldron
back from the Demon Lord.

I've heard about you;
my cousin's been spending
time in your country.

@s(3)and we'll show the
Demon Lord that he has
underestimated our resolve.

@s(3)The pride that keeps you
so fearless @w(6)will be the thing
that leads to your death.

@M(1)As you can see, we have
been utterly defeated. Queen
Elfaria has been killed.

@s(3)@M(1)Where were the royal
guards!? You said I could
leave everything to you!

@s(3)@M(1)What were you doing!?
Why did you not protect
my mother!?

@M(3)The one that chews on
the roots of the ash tree...
I will always resist fate...

@s(3)An unavoidable curse
and death shall be
unleashed upon us both.

She believed my words, but
if she sees my mystic power,
she'll change her mind...

@M(3)Wipe away my
sins, and my body
with them...

@s(3)Controlling the dragon,
the sorcerer complied with
Melvin's orders...

@s(3)My Belderiver was not at
full strength, and the
revolution was near failure...

